<p>When attacking from stealth, you slip a garrote over the target’s neck (or other vulnerable part).  This strangles for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns and silences for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.  Strangled targets are pinned and suffer an automatic unarmed attack for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60%</acronym> damage each turn. </p><p>Your chance to apply the garrote increases with your Accuracy and you must stay adjacent to your target to maintain it.</p><p>This talent has a cooldown.</p>